1872:Drivers/CMSIS/Include/core_cm7.h ****   \brief   Set Priority Grouping
1873:Drivers/CMSIS/Include/core_cm7.h ****   \details Sets the priority grouping field using the required unlock sequence.
1874:Drivers/CMSIS/Include/core_cm7.h ****            The parameter PriorityGroup is assigned to the field SCB->AIRCR [10:8] PRIGROUP field.
1875:Drivers/CMSIS/Include/core_cm7.h ****            Only values from 0..7 are used.
1876:Drivers/CMSIS/Include/core_cm7.h ****            In case of a conflict between priority grouping and available
1877:Drivers/CMSIS/Include/core_cm7.h ****            priority bits (__NVIC_PRIO_BITS), the smallest possible priority group is set.
1878:Drivers/CMSIS/Include/core_cm7.h ****   \param [in]      PriorityGroup  Priority grouping field.
